<title>USA: Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</title>
<headline>Central U.S. carlot pork at 1500 CST - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Compared with Thursday's close, Fresh loins steady to weak; butts steady to $2.00 higher; skinned hams steady; seedless bellies 12-14 lbs firm in light test; lean trimmings firm in light test. - USDA</p>
<p>Trading was slow to moderate, with light to moderate demand and offerings.</p>
